    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rest or change approach... i don't think you get it. it's not just a slump. it's like the well has run dry. i look at my old work and it's like looking at a stranger. if i keep going, i'm just going to produce mediocre, hollow stuff until i'm just... some old person who used to be good once. i'd honestly rather just stop now while i'm still \"something\" than live to see myself become a joke.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
